    <para styleclass="Normal"><anchor id="Overview" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true"> &#160; </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="SectionHeader" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td style="height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Overview </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px; height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The &quot;Editor Bookmarks&quot; expert offers convenient ways to create, handle and use bookmarks. The expert has a dockable main window; this mode should also be the primary form of use. The expert complements the bookmark function available in the IDE and offers new ways to keep a good overview of the bookmarks set and to access them specifically. </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><table styleclass="NoticeBox" rowcount="3" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#ff0000;" translate="true">Notice</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="0" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">In Delphi 7, bookmarks are not saved by the IDE. In Delphi 2010, this happens automatically, allowing the expert to be used optimally. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass=" " style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;" translate="true">&#32;</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Unfortunately, due to system constraints, the experts help cannot be called with F1 in </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; text-decoration:underline;" translate="true">docked</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> windows. If a dockable window is currently undocked, the F1 key can be used. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass=" " style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;" translate="true">&#32;</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="2" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass=" " style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;" translate="true">In current Delphi versions the plugin &quot;Bookmarks&quot; available via &quot;GetIt&quot; can be used. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:center; margin-top:30px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:24px; margin-left:6px;"><image src="EditorBookmarks00General.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="100.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"></image></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><anchor id="SettingBookmarks" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true"> &#160; </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="SectionHeader" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td>
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Setting bookmarks </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px; height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Bookmarks now can be set in three different ways: </text></para>
    <list id="3" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">As usual via the IDE (Bookmarks 0 ... 9). </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The 1st toolbutton is used to set the first free bookmark for the caret position in the editor (Bookmarks 0 ... 19). Duplicate entry for the same line is prevented. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="4" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If specified in the options, this automatic function can be deactivated and the editor window known from earlier version will be called by the 1st toolbutton to optionally set any bookmark. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="5" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The 2nd toolbutton opens an additional window in which the position of the new bookmark can be set from a list of all functions and procedures of the active file in the IDE. </text></li>
    </list>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><table styleclass="NoticeBox" rowcount="2" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#ff0000;" translate="true">Notice</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="6" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Try to keep your methods as short as possible and, if useful, place the bookmark on the method header! </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">&#32;</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="7" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If enabled, the expert prevents the creation of duplicate bookmarks within a line. However, this is generally possible within the IDE (and in &quot;Editor Bookmarks&quot; Edit form)</text><text styleclass=" " style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;" translate="true">. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><anchor id="EditAndDeleteBookmarks" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true"> &#160; </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="SectionHeader" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td style="height:24px; ">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Edit and delete bookmarks </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:4px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <list id="8" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If specified in the options, a 3rd toolbutton (as shown above) appears and let you modify an existing bookmark. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Using the toolbuttons with the red cross or the trash can symbol, individual or all existing bookmarks can be deleted. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"></li>
    </list>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><table styleclass="NoticeBox" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#ff0000;" translate="true">Notice</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="9" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#000000;" translate="true">O</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">f course the bookmarks can also be deleted directly via keyboard command in the IDE editor. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><anchor id="BookmarkList" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true"> &#160; </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="SectionHeader" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td style="height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Bookmarks list </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px; height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <list id="10" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Activated bookmarks are displayed in the listbox of the expert window. The header of each bookmark item contains its index, the name of the assigned function/procedure (a leading dot marks a class method) and the line number. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Below the header, an excerpt of the source text before and after the bookmark is shown, the bookmark line is highlighted. In the options, you can set whether 3 or 5 lines are shown at this point. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The file name of the source text file for which the bookmarks are set is displayed in the 1st panel of the statusbar. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">By repeatedly clicking on the lightning symbol in the toolbar, the list can be sorted by the attributes </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">BookmarkIndex</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">, </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">MethodName</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> and </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">LineNumber</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">. The active sort mode is displayed in the 2nd panel of the statusbar. </text></li>
    </list>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><table styleclass="NoticeBox" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:top">
        <td style="width:48px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#ff0000;" translate="true">Notice</text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:top;">
          <list id="11" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
            <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-left:8px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Unfortunately, the determination of the method identifier within INC files is still faulty. </text></li>
          </list>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; text-indent:-54px; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:30px; margin-left:60px;"><draft-comment id="ANNOT1733BC" width="300px" height="100px" modified="2025-06-02T00:35:11.804+02:00" styleclass="Comment"><![CDATA[Placing a DistanceAfter of 30 pixels at the end of all topics included in TOC improves the appearance of PDF output.

Ghost | rzrz]]></draft-comment><text styleclass="Comment" translate="true">&#32;</text></para>
  </body>
</topic>
